{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792502400, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}}
[0.015284, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.015381, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.0154, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01543, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m  4 \u00b7 Govern\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.017632, "o", "\u001b[2m  recorded run \u00b7 Tue 20 Oct 2026, 15:20 CEST\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01766, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.02038, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Where a model may run is a label on the clusters and a selector on the deployment.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.02309, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Making it mandatory is an admission policy in the API: testable and auditable, not a wiki \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    page.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.023255, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 Where this model may run\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.023271, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl -n ml-team get modeldeployment qwen-7b -o yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.056988, "o", "  \u001b[36mspec\u001b[0m:\r\n    \u001b[36mtemplate\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[0.057042, "o", "      \u001b[36mspec\u001b[0m:\r\n        \u001b[36mclusterSelector\u001b[0m:\r\n          \u001b[36mmatchLabels\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mjurisdiction\u001b[0m: eu\r\n        \u001b[36mmodelCacheRef\u001b[0m:\r\n          \u001b[36mname\u001b[0m: qwen-7b\r\n"]
[0.057501, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.057531, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 The rule, in the API\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.057559, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl get validatingadmissionpolicy eu-only-model-deployments -o yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.086218, "o", "  \u001b[36mhas(object.spec.template.spec.clusterSelector) &&\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[36mhas(object.spec.template.spec.clusterSelector.matchLabels) &&\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[36m'jurisdiction' in object.spec.template.spec.clusterSelector.matchLabels &&\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[36mobject.spec.template.spec.clusterSelector.matchLabels['jurisdiction'] == 'eu'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.086435, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.086471, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.086481, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 A team tries to deploy without the EU selector\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.086519, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl -n ml-team apply --dry-run=server \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.086538, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -f policies/test/qwen-anywhere.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.086549, "o", "\u001b[2m  a server-side dry run: admission runs, nothing is stored\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.131767, "o", "\u001b[31m  denied by ValidatingAdmissionPolicy eu-only-model-deployments:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.134308, "o", "  \u001b[31mModelDeployments in this namespace must set \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31mspec.template.spec.clusterSelector.matchLabels.jurisdiction: eu.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.134483, "o", "\u001b[2m  The policy binds to namespaces labelled jurisdiction=eu, such as ml-team.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.134501, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\ud83d\udca1 Jurisdiction is a label. Enforcement is policy in the API.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
